WEBVTT

00:03.790 --> 00:05.970
<i>The cultural festival was a success.</i>

00:09.400 --> 00:12.280
Personal Planning Survey

00:09.400 --> 00:12.280
<b>Name </b>  Komura Kaede

00:09.930 --> 00:12.280
<i>And now, the time has come.</i>

00:12.880 --> 00:15.320
<i>I have a rough idea of which 
school I want to go to,</i>

00:16.000 --> 00:18.860
<i>but I guess I'll talk it over with Mom again.</i>

00:18.860 --> 00:22.580
What do you want to do in 
the future, Komura-kun?

00:22.910 --> 00:24.060
My dreams?

00:24.060 --> 00:24.690
Yeah.

00:24.690 --> 00:27.320
I was just wondering about the survey.

00:29.650 --> 00:31.280
A gamer or something?

00:31.280 --> 00:32.920
No, well...

00:32.920 --> 00:34.490
I do like gaming, but...

00:35.040 --> 00:37.200
<i>My future?</i>

00:37.810 --> 00:42.980
<i>I've only really thought about going 
into high school and finding a job.</i>

00:43.360 --> 00:44.880
I-I'm not telling.

00:45.890 --> 00:49.860
I don't want Mie-san to find 
out that I have no dreams.

00:49.860 --> 00:53.030
Can I tell you about my dream, then?

00:53.970 --> 00:55.780
Yes, please!

00:56.050 --> 00:59.220
I apologize for sharing mine when 
you aren't sharing yours, but...

00:59.220 --> 01:02.660
<i>I could listen to Mie-san forever.</i>

01:02.940 --> 01:05.660
Hang on, I have a picture.

01:10.970 --> 01:11.570
Found it!

01:11.570 --> 01:12.870
I think this is it.

01:12.870 --> 01:16.180
I was looking at my preschool 
graduation album.

01:16.550 --> 01:21.430
And under "dreams for the 
future," I had "Dad's bride."

01:21.680 --> 01:23.630
<i>That sounds like Mie-san.</i>

01:24.430 --> 01:26.730
It made me laugh.

01:25.430 --> 01:29.440
Dad's bride
 Dream for the future

 Cake   Stew
 Favorite food

01:41.750 --> 01:42.830
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

01:42.830 --> 01:45.840
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

03:06.950 --> 03:08.460
Komura-kun?

03:06.960 --> 03:11.930
Episode 12

03:06.960 --> 03:11.930
I Wanted To Practice

03:06.960 --> 03:11.930
Cooking With the Girl I Like.

03:08.460 --> 03:09.460
What's wrong?

03:10.410 --> 03:12.520
Wait, was that the wrong picture?

03:12.520 --> 03:14.460
No, it was the right one.

03:14.810 --> 03:17.960
H-How old were you in that photo?

03:17.960 --> 03:20.030
<i>Someone arrest me, please.</i>

03:20.760 --> 03:23.680
I think I was about five.

03:23.680 --> 03:24.710
Six?

03:24.710 --> 03:27.600
I was really round back then.

03:28.030 --> 03:31.450
I'm not showing you my picture, though!

03:31.450 --> 03:32.600
It's embarrassing.

03:34.820 --> 03:36.610
<i>I think I should forget about it.</i>

03:37.370 --> 03:40.660
Anyway, I was such a child, huh?

03:40.660 --> 03:41.630
What about now?

03:43.360 --> 03:45.820
What's your dream now?

03:47.920 --> 03:49.330
Nothing, really.

03:49.360 --> 03:49.910
Huh?

03:52.370 --> 03:54.950
I want to own a fish someday, though.

03:54.950 --> 03:55.840
<i>Oh.</i>

03:55.840 --> 03:57.340
<i>I guess Mie-san's the same way, too.</i>

03:59.170 --> 04:03.340
And I do want to get married, I guess.

04:03.340 --> 04:05.610
Just not to Dad, of course.

04:06.080 --> 04:10.080
<i>Mie-san kind of sees me like her dad, though.</i>

04:10.990 --> 04:13.350
<i>I wonder who she'd want to marry?</i>

04:13.900 --> 04:16.060
<i>I don't think I want to think about it.</i>

04:17.100 --> 04:20.640
I'm kinda training for the part, too.

04:20.640 --> 04:22.860
I'm pretty good at making omurice.

04:23.960 --> 04:26.810
<i>It's kinda surprising to think 
Mie-san can cook, isn't it?</i>

04:27.550 --> 04:28.710
One second.

04:28.710 --> 04:31.210
I think I have pictures of my omurice.

04:31.210 --> 04:31.980
Found it!

04:32.400 --> 04:34.210
I made this the other day.

04:34.210 --> 04:38.170
The egg didn't turn out too 
pretty, but it was good.

04:38.710 --> 04:39.790
It looks good.

04:39.790 --> 04:41.710
<i>Information overload.</i>

04:41.710 --> 04:45.280
<i>I don't think there's anything 
I shouldn't look at, is there?</i>

04:45.280 --> 04:47.110
What did you draw with your ketchup?

04:47.110 --> 04:47.720
A hand?

04:54.390 --> 04:55.680
It's nothing!

04:56.470 --> 04:57.130
A hand!

04:57.130 --> 04:58.480
Yeah, a hand!

04:58.990 --> 05:01.260
<i>Did I upset her?</i>

05:04.490 --> 05:07.060
Should be around here...

05:07.760 --> 05:08.610
Found it.

05:08.610 --> 05:10.580
My preschool album.

05:10.580 --> 05:15.040
Memories

05:11.200 --> 05:15.040
<i>I wonder if I had any dreams 
for the future back then.</i>

05:18.090 --> 05:21.590
Office Worker
 Komura Kaede

05:21.930 --> 05:23.250
<i>Dreams!</i>

05:23.250 --> 05:25.700
<i>Have I never had any dreams?!</i>

05:25.700 --> 05:28.890
<i>I seriously have no memories 
of myself back then.</i>

05:28.890 --> 05:31.600
<i>In fact, I hardly have any 
memories of elementary school.</i>

05:32.760 --> 05:37.850
<i>I practically had no self awareness 
until I fell in love with Mie-san.</i>

05:37.850 --> 05:40.140
Kaede. Dinner.

05:40.140 --> 05:41.200
Coming.

05:56.520 --> 05:59.120
<i>It was something like this, wasn't it?</i>

06:01.940 --> 06:03.310
A kaede (maple) leaf?

06:04.510 --> 06:07.330
Isn't that a maple leaf?

06:07.330 --> 06:08.520
Or not?

06:08.520 --> 06:09.510
Is that a hand?

06:13.380 --> 06:15.450
I think it's a hand.

06:15.450 --> 06:17.850
What do you mean, you <i>think</i>?

06:17.850 --> 06:18.910
Yeah.

06:18.910 --> 06:20.840
It's a hand.

06:20.270 --> 06:24.610
<b>Squish squish</b>

06:20.840 --> 06:24.610
<i>Even if it was a maple leaf, 
that's not what she meant.</i>

06:27.270 --> 06:31.450
<i>I wonder what Mie-san's omurice tastes like?</i>

06:31.450 --> 06:36.370
<i>If she made omurice for me and 
drew something in ketchup...</i>

06:38.530 --> 06:39.180
Well?

06:39.180 --> 06:42.110
<i>...And Mie-san's next to me.</i>

06:40.040 --> 06:40.940
Is it good?

06:45.920 --> 06:46.810
What?

06:48.630 --> 06:49.360
Nothing...

06:55.180 --> 06:56.460
<i>That was...</i>

06:57.630 --> 07:00.720
<i>my future dream, wasn't it?</i>

07:10.200 --> 07:15.200
Class 3-B   Name Komura Kaede
Please write, in specifics, what you would like to do after you graduate.
First choice Mie-san's husband
Second choice

07:10.600 --> 07:12.130
<i>Nah, nah, nah.</i>

07:12.130 --> 07:14.220
<i>That's a bit messed up.</i>

07:15.520 --> 07:17.410
<i>A guy can dream, right?</i>

07:17.410 --> 07:19.100
<i>It's just a dream.</i>

07:19.100 --> 07:20.630
Morning, Komura-kun.

07:22.020 --> 07:23.790
Is that the personal planning form?

07:24.710 --> 07:26.710
husband

07:27.120 --> 07:28.110
Whose?

07:30.660 --> 07:31.500
Um...

07:32.790 --> 07:35.180
No one in particular.

07:35.640 --> 07:38.570
Just that, like, I guess 
I should get married, right?

07:39.680 --> 07:40.930
<i>Oh, well.</i>

07:40.930 --> 07:42.590
<i>She's going to think I'm a goof.</i>

07:46.920 --> 07:48.150
Huh?

07:51.860 --> 07:53.790
A-Are you angry?

07:54.320 --> 07:55.660
I'm fine.

07:57.660 --> 07:59.910
<i>What?!</i>

08:00.660 --> 08:03.040
<b>Home Economics</b>

08:09.600 --> 08:11.440
I think that should do it.

08:13.350 --> 08:15.130
Thanks, Mie-san.

08:15.130 --> 08:16.020
Not at all.

08:16.020 --> 08:17.850
<i>Today is cooking practice day.</i>

08:18.660 --> 08:20.640
<i>We're grouped together by random draw.</i>

08:20.640 --> 08:21.670
Are you okay?

08:22.150 --> 08:23.560
Y-Yeah.

08:23.560 --> 08:24.630
<i>Darn!</i>

08:24.630 --> 08:29.280
<i>That group gets to enjoy 
cookies hand-made by Mie-san.</i>

08:31.030 --> 08:33.960
<i>I'll add that to my list 
of things I want to eat.</i>

08:31.190 --> 08:34.740
<b>Mie-san's omurice</b>

08:32.900 --> 08:34.740
<b>Mie-san's cookies</b>

08:34.740 --> 08:37.100
Komura-kun, could you get the wrap?

08:37.100 --> 08:38.240
Huh? Yeah.

08:38.240 --> 08:39.170
<i>Buck up.</i>

08:39.170 --> 08:40.640
<i>I gotta focus.</i>

08:40.640 --> 08:42.480
<i>Stop worrying about them.</i>

08:43.250 --> 08:46.300
<i>So close!</i>

08:45.110 --> 08:46.300
It looks good.

08:46.760 --> 08:48.390
<i>Azuma-kun, please!</i>

08:48.390 --> 08:53.630
<i>Please turn off your hot-guy 
fragrance for just one second!</i>

08:53.630 --> 08:56.140
It doesn't look like a coin, though.

08:57.500 --> 08:59.820
I'm trying to make it look like a coin.

08:59.820 --> 09:01.680
Like an arcade token?

09:01.680 --> 09:05.980
Like
this

09:01.990 --> 09:04.840
What if you tried putting lines around it?

09:04.840 --> 09:05.980
I see.

09:05.980 --> 09:10.730
I'm sure Komura-kun would appreciate 
it no matter what, though.

09:11.030 --> 09:13.990
He'd like it more if it's cute, though.

09:18.100 --> 09:20.490
Wait, did I say I was giving it to him?

09:20.990 --> 09:23.350
<i>She's having fun!</i>

09:23.350 --> 09:24.300
Do coins...

09:24.300 --> 09:25.610
Is he okay?

09:25.610 --> 09:27.500
He's like this sometimes.

09:27.500 --> 09:30.500
I don't think a coin's a good idea right now.

09:30.500 --> 09:31.990
Huh? Why?

09:32.410 --> 09:36.720
The token dispenser at the arcade the 
other day was out of service.

09:36.720 --> 09:38.850
He was a bit bummed out.

09:39.520 --> 09:41.720
You mean he ran out of tokens?

09:41.720 --> 09:42.520
Yeah.

09:44.110 --> 09:47.020
That kind of thing gets to him, huh?

09:47.020 --> 09:49.020
"That kind of thing"?

09:49.020 --> 09:50.650
It's a big deal.

09:50.650 --> 09:53.030
Although, he did recover pretty quickly.

09:53.030 --> 09:54.820
<i>Yasaka-kun, you too?!</i>

09:54.820 --> 09:56.170
<i>Everyone betrayed me!</i>

09:56.170 --> 09:58.530
<i>Dammit. I can't hear what they're saying!</i>

09:58.760 --> 10:02.380
Does Komura-kun always play 
the coin games at the arcade?

10:02.380 --> 10:03.540
I'd say so.

10:03.540 --> 10:06.580
He goes all quiet and zen.

10:03.830 --> 10:08.540
<b>Click</b>

10:05.080 --> 10:08.540
Clank

10:05.080 --> 10:08.540
Clank

10:06.330 --> 10:08.540
<b>Click</b>

10:06.580 --> 10:07.580
Zen?

10:07.580 --> 10:08.540
Clank

10:08.820 --> 10:11.340
And he plays the crane catchers sometimes.

10:11.340 --> 10:12.040
For snacks.

10:12.720 --> 10:15.800
Seems like he gives most 
of his winnings to his mom.

10:18.720 --> 10:19.680
Well...

10:19.680 --> 10:21.600
I guess no coins, then, huh?

10:21.920 --> 10:24.970
Well, he's not bummed 
anymore. I think it's fine.

10:25.220 --> 10:26.420
Which is it?

10:26.420 --> 10:28.520
Okay, I'll continue making lines, then.

10:28.520 --> 10:29.280
Okay?

10:30.080 --> 10:30.790
Lines?

10:31.210 --> 10:32.360
Yeah, sure, I guess.

10:35.400 --> 10:39.270
You're pretty slow even 
with your glasses, huh?

10:39.270 --> 10:40.860
What's that supposed to mean?

10:41.890 --> 10:43.770
Nothing. Sorry.

10:43.770 --> 10:44.570
A bird?

10:45.740 --> 10:47.240
You're so good.

10:47.240 --> 10:48.620
Do you like them?

10:48.620 --> 10:49.450
Yeah.

10:49.450 --> 10:51.750
There's a lady who lives next door.

10:56.950 --> 10:58.280
Do you like her?

10:59.870 --> 11:02.720
How old is that lady?

11:02.720 --> 11:03.860
A college student.

11:04.710 --> 11:05.820
So grown-up.

11:05.820 --> 11:06.990
She is.

11:07.450 --> 11:09.770
So she won't even look at me.

11:11.880 --> 11:13.430
I need an opportunity.

11:13.430 --> 11:15.270
Mind if I copy you?

11:15.600 --> 11:16.690
Go ahead.

11:17.260 --> 11:18.300
Thanks.

11:18.910 --> 11:20.700
I'll do my best to actually tell her.

11:23.690 --> 11:25.300
Do you have to tell her?

11:27.800 --> 11:30.740
I might not get to be with her 
in the future otherwise, right?

11:36.080 --> 11:37.590
Gotta keep making lines.

11:42.440 --> 11:43.660
Azuma-kun.

11:44.160 --> 11:44.930
Bye.

11:45.260 --> 11:46.140
Bye.

11:47.720 --> 11:50.060
<i>They've gotten really close!</i>

11:50.060 --> 11:51.760
<i>I'm screwed.</i>

11:51.760 --> 11:54.560
<i>He didn't go easy on the hot-guy fragrance.</i>

11:54.560 --> 11:58.690
M-Mie-chan, what were you 
talking to Azuma-kun about?

11:58.690 --> 12:00.400
<i>Please, don't!</i>

12:00.400 --> 12:01.680
<i>I don't want to hear it!</i>

12:01.680 --> 12:02.950
So...

12:03.560 --> 12:06.220
Azuma-kun's thinking a lot.

12:06.220 --> 12:08.200
He's a real grown-up.

12:10.970 --> 12:12.000
<i>Nope.</i>

12:12.000 --> 12:13.790
<i>I need to get out of here.</i>

12:14.440 --> 12:17.080
<i>All she did was compliment Azuma-kun.</i>

12:17.080 --> 12:19.300
<i>How could that be so painful?</i>

12:21.340 --> 12:22.300
<i>This sucks.</i>

12:22.560 --> 12:25.240
<i>Have I always been this petty?</i>

12:25.240 --> 12:26.300
Komura-kun!

12:26.530 --> 12:27.740
Komura-kun!

12:37.370 --> 12:39.020
Wait, wait...

12:40.770 --> 12:42.400
Sorry, I didn't realize.

12:42.400 --> 12:43.960
H-Hang on, I'll get water.

12:53.460 --> 12:55.350
Thanks for the water.

12:55.350 --> 12:56.630
N-Nah.

12:57.190 --> 12:59.270
Good thing I had my glasses on.

12:59.270 --> 13:01.840
I might have lost you otherwise.

13:02.110 --> 13:05.800
You were just fast-walking though.

13:06.070 --> 13:10.600
Apparently, I'm slow, 
even with my glasses on.

13:10.600 --> 13:12.060
Azuma-kun said so.

13:13.510 --> 13:16.850
Am I slow?

13:18.640 --> 13:21.420
W-We should get going...

13:27.250 --> 13:28.180
For you.

13:31.780 --> 13:33.450
Th-Thanks.

13:33.450 --> 13:36.250
<i>Just like that, I was in a good mood.</i>

13:36.500 --> 13:41.220
They look like circles,
but they're actually coins.

13:41.220 --> 13:42.630
Y-You're right.

13:43.380 --> 13:44.210
Have some.

13:44.620 --> 13:45.600
Okay.

13:45.600 --> 13:46.760
Thanks.

13:49.640 --> 13:52.180
Hey, so, those cookies...

13:54.460 --> 13:57.600
I wanted you to have them.

14:01.070 --> 14:06.620
I thought you might be hungry.

14:13.070 --> 14:13.680
Yeah.

14:13.680 --> 14:14.620
Thanks.

14:15.070 --> 14:18.120
<i>Mie-san's always been weird, hasn't she?</i>

14:18.480 --> 14:21.630
Is it bad that I'm slow?

14:23.000 --> 14:27.590
N-No, you being easy going 
is totally a positive.

14:27.920 --> 14:30.610
Like, you make everyone feel relaxed.

14:30.610 --> 14:33.470
I don't think Azuma-kun meant 
it in a bad way, either.

14:47.300 --> 14:51.410
<i>I don't want her to panic like just now.</i>

14:52.960 --> 14:54.910
<i>I should walk slowly, too,</i>

14:55.450 --> 14:58.060
<i>so I don't leave Mie-san behind.</i>

14:58.060 --> 14:59.080
Is it good?

14:59.810 --> 15:00.490
Yeah.

15:04.420 --> 15:08.130
<b>Helpful Enough!</b>

15:04.420 --> 15:08.130
<i>Can they make it to the shop?</i>

15:10.070 --> 15:13.230
<i>Mini-Mie-san was so cute.</i>

15:15.220 --> 15:15.890
<i>Stop!</i>

15:16.790 --> 15:19.420
<i>I wasn't supposed to see that picture.</i>

15:19.420 --> 15:21.110
<i>Forget about it.</i>

15:22.270 --> 15:25.350
<i>I wonder what I was like when I was little.</i>

15:27.230 --> 15:28.320
<i>Mom...</i>

15:28.890 --> 15:31.460
<i>Why do you keep these kinds of photos?</i>

15:31.460 --> 15:33.450
<i>What kind of fall is this?</i>

15:34.630 --> 15:39.110
<i>My mom seems to enjoy embarrassing her son.</i>

15:39.960 --> 15:42.000
Kaede, dinner.

15:42.000 --> 15:43.120
Coming.

15:43.120 --> 15:46.120
I was looking at my old albums, and Mom...

15:46.120 --> 15:47.630
Huh? What?

15:48.170 --> 15:50.670
<b>Class 3-B</b>

15:57.400 --> 15:58.370
Komura.

15:58.800 --> 15:59.890
What's this photo?

16:01.940 --> 16:03.200
Give it back!

16:03.200 --> 16:04.050
How?!

16:04.050 --> 16:06.150
Did you find it between something?

16:07.180 --> 16:08.720
Why do you have a nosebleed?

16:08.720 --> 16:11.210
<i>Did it have to be that<i> picture?</i></i>

16:11.210 --> 16:13.130
I-I fell off the bars.

16:13.130 --> 16:14.660
Just give it back!

16:14.930 --> 16:15.900
Pictures?

16:16.910 --> 16:18.760
From when Komura was a kid.

16:31.090 --> 16:32.670
What's it a picture of?

16:32.670 --> 16:35.250
A picture of him falling off the 
bars and crying with a nosebleed.

16:35.250 --> 16:36.890
I'm not crying, though!

16:37.390 --> 16:40.850
You used to have black hair, huh?

16:40.850 --> 16:42.220
Y-Yeah.

16:43.650 --> 16:45.400
You can do it, Mie-chan.

16:50.620 --> 16:51.610
Sorry!

16:52.770 --> 16:54.530
I-It's fine.

16:58.120 --> 16:59.990
All right, sit down.

17:00.620 --> 17:02.580
Let's get started.

17:03.020 --> 17:05.620
<i>It's turned into a national 
cultural treasure.</i>

17:07.470 --> 17:09.630
Komura-kun, let's go home together.

17:09.960 --> 17:10.740
Huh?

17:10.740 --> 17:12.130
O-Okay.

17:15.590 --> 17:18.640
<i>I feel like we've been going 
home together a lot lately.</i>

17:18.640 --> 17:20.200
<i>I wonder if it's okay.</i>

17:20.200 --> 17:22.640
<i>People aren't going to get 
the wrong idea, are they?</i>

17:27.320 --> 17:29.830
Hey, wanna stop by the park?

17:31.200 --> 17:32.560
Wh-Why?

17:32.560 --> 17:33.550
For fun.

17:33.550 --> 17:34.670
<i>That was sudden.</i>

17:37.780 --> 17:42.240
I think I'm going to need my glasses to 
have fun, so I'll run back home real quick.

17:42.240 --> 17:43.660
<i>That's pretty hectic.</i>

17:44.490 --> 17:46.230
Sh-Should I come with?

17:46.230 --> 17:47.060
I'll be fine.

17:47.060 --> 17:48.480
I'll be right back.

17:49.920 --> 17:51.500
Stay safe.

17:51.850 --> 17:55.910
<i>Maybe she felt like playing on the bars 
because we were talking about them today.</i>

17:56.630 --> 18:00.060
<i>This feels like an after-school date.</i>

18:01.330 --> 18:02.970
<i>Stop thinking like that!</i>

18:05.060 --> 18:07.960
<i>How long has it been since 
I played on the bars?</i>

18:07.960 --> 18:14.010
<i>I think I fell trying 
to do a back hip flip.</i>

18:14.010 --> 18:14.690
<i>Probably.</i>

18:15.840 --> 18:16.540
<i>Yeah.</i>

18:20.130 --> 18:20.780
<i>Wait...</i>

18:26.830 --> 18:28.470
<i>I can't do it at all.</i>

18:30.320 --> 18:32.520
Komura-kun, I'm back.

18:32.520 --> 18:33.800
Welcome back.

18:33.800 --> 18:34.890
I've already gotten started.

18:35.610 --> 18:36.740
Doing what?

18:36.740 --> 18:38.520
Oh, I know.

18:38.520 --> 18:41.300
Now that I have my glasses...

18:41.600 --> 18:44.310
Can I see that photo, too?

18:45.140 --> 18:48.320
<i>I-Is this why she brought me here?</i>

18:48.770 --> 18:54.840
<i>I guess if everyone else's seen it 
and she hasn't, she'd want to...</i>

18:55.770 --> 19:00.860
<i>I have it on my criminal record that I've 
looked at her preschool picture, too, so...</i>

19:01.130 --> 19:02.860
J-Just one second.

19:07.950 --> 19:09.660
<i>I forgot it at school.</i>

19:10.120 --> 19:11.440
I forgot it.

19:13.080 --> 19:14.170
Oh...

19:14.640 --> 19:18.890
<i>I didn't know how I should deal 
with a national cultural treasure,</i>

19:18.890 --> 19:20.810
<i>so I left it at school for now.</i>

19:22.450 --> 19:24.450
I-I'll show you tomorrow.

19:24.450 --> 19:25.180
Yeah.

19:25.580 --> 19:26.760
Want me to go get it?

19:28.080 --> 19:29.980
No, it's okay.

19:30.410 --> 19:33.130
Why did you fall off the bars?

19:33.130 --> 19:35.690
I-I was trying to do a back hip flip.

19:36.480 --> 19:37.690
Can you do it now?

19:40.000 --> 19:41.790
I-I guess.

19:42.400 --> 19:43.340
Can I see?

19:44.950 --> 19:47.880
<i>Why did I have to show off?!</i>

19:48.450 --> 19:50.840
<i>God, please give me your grace.</i>

19:53.930 --> 19:55.040
Don't worry about it.

19:55.040 --> 19:55.880
It's all good.

19:55.880 --> 19:57.170
<i>God! God?!</i>

19:57.850 --> 20:00.530
<i>I don't want this to be the 
last thing she sees today.</i>

20:01.920 --> 20:04.470
<i>Please... God.</i>

20:05.970 --> 20:08.470
<i>Please... me!</i>

20:20.000 --> 20:20.490
<i>I did...</i>

20:26.000 --> 20:27.260
Oh, wait.

20:27.260 --> 20:28.280
Hold still.

20:34.200 --> 20:35.500
Hey, err...

20:36.270 --> 20:38.170
I'll send it to you, too.

20:41.250 --> 20:43.640
You can't show anyone else.

20:45.410 --> 20:47.740
<i>Why would she do that?</i>

20:48.990 --> 20:52.230
<i>Why would she say that?</i>

20:53.040 --> 20:54.240
Hold this.

20:55.980 --> 20:58.790
I don't think I could do a back hip flip.

20:59.360 --> 21:01.650
I could do propellers forever, though.

21:11.150 --> 21:12.700
I guess I can't.

21:14.920 --> 21:15.680
Huh?

21:15.680 --> 21:17.430
I was wearing shorts, right?

21:17.430 --> 21:18.820
Y-Yeah.

21:18.820 --> 21:19.590
You're good.

21:19.590 --> 21:20.630
They were shorts.

21:21.520 --> 21:22.510
Thank goodness.

21:26.140 --> 21:27.690
What happened to your nose?

21:29.280 --> 21:30.210
Why?

21:30.730 --> 21:32.140
No, I, err...

21:32.560 --> 21:33.380
Sorry.

21:34.080 --> 21:39.980
<i>I don't think I'm ever going to be able to 
think about bars without thinking about nosebleeds.</i>

23:11.120 --> 23:12.910
Komura Kaede here.

23:12.910 --> 23:15.120
I guess this is the last preview, huh?

23:15.890 --> 23:20.860
That day, Mie-san ran into her 
classmate from elementary school.

23:20.860 --> 23:25.590
But Mie-san doesn't remember 
his face that well.

23:26.160 --> 23:29.890
Komura-kun wonders if he might 
be forgotten someday, too,

23:29.890 --> 23:32.930
so he decides to work up some courage.

23:33.390 --> 23:39.940
Episode 13

23:33.390 --> 23:39.940
The Girl I like and I Made a Promise

23:33.630 --> 23:36.550
Next episode: The Girl I 
like and I Made a Promise

23:36.550 --> 23:39.270
Whoa, I did a proper episode preview!
